            <ArticleTitle>Incidental 67Ga uptake into an appendiceal mucocele in a patient with sigmoid colon cancer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>257-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of sigmoid colon cancer in which visualization of an appendiceal mucocele was unexpectedly found during 67Ga scintigraphy, and discuss a proposed mechanism of uptake.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
